{"id":"vod_sn_36010","vodId":"36010","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"舞姬","name_cn":"舞姬","date":"2004-01-01","year":"2004","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8851b11f56d2ac86d2a634f0a9b2420f.jpg"},"summary":"鸨羽舞衣与弟弟巧海在摇摆的邮轮上等待到案，他们的目的地是名为“风华学园”的高等学校。父母双亡的舞衣意外获得了风华学院的奖学金，决定与弟弟一起转到这所学校。　　大海航行之中，舞衣突然发现大海上漂流的一名少女。这名抱着大剑的少女名叫美袋命，舞衣将她救上船。随后，船上又出现一名名叫玖我夏树的神秘长发女子。夏树见到命之后立即要取对方性命，并召唤出机械兽参加战斗！舞衣被眼前发生的情景震惊，但此时，她的超能力也觉醒！原来舞衣也是拥有“HiME力量”的超能力者。　　战斗过后，舞衣与弟弟巧海继续向风华学园前进，却不知道，那里等待他们的，是HiME力量的秘密与宿命的束缚。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:39:35","playable":true,"episodeCount":27,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dxhLxdpY2a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yt568SzkmU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eazfgniqfe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/6d6i7UGBt41/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/h1decPYLCF1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WGjuuewrWN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gFUS71N7Bp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dymd8Bxuj01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Jqr0ySSF5K1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vSwurXn3DN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PkdYdWMptX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J9Jk3dC0pm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UcgKtxZD7B1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MwpeNuQ6ty1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"http